[00:00.000] 作词 : Ariana Grande/Max Martin/Ilya Salmanzadeh
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Ariana Grande/Max Martin/Ilya Salmanzadeh
[00:17.288]Did I dream the whole thing? ( 一切是否仅仅是我的幻梦一场？)
[00:21.701]Was I just a nightmare? ( 难道我不过是梦魇的化身？)
[00:26.107]Different dimensions ( 横跨不同的维度)
[00:30.153]Stuck in the Twilight Zone ( 被困在这阴阳魔界之中)
[00:33.742]Is this a black and white scene? ( 这一幕是否为黑白画面？)
[00:37.916]If so, then I'm in the gray one ( 如果如此 那我身处灰色地带)
[00:42.343]Hope you win for best actor ( 希望你赢得最佳男主角)
[00:45.463]'Cause I had you completely wrong ( 因为我从未认识到真正的你)
[00:51.423]Does she know ( 她知道吗)
[00:53.050]You're not who you say you are? ( 你并非你所声称的那样？)
[00:56.183]'Cause I might give her a call ( 因为或许我会致电于她)
[01:00.071]Or was I just not me at all? ( 还是我根本就不是自己？)
